# GMS's is Sharp Eyes - Persist, which buys the buff thirty more seconds. Sharp
# Eyes is folded in here as a permanent passive, so there is no duration to
# lengthen and nothing to delete down to -- it is renamed for the DEF it hands
# out instead.
#
# Which is worth nothing, deliberately: DEF stops paying at a share of the
# attacking monster's own attack, and a Bow Master has passed that cap on their
# stats alone. See SkillEffect.def_pct, dead by the same design. The Hero's
# Advanced Combo Attack - Barricade is the other one.
#
# Alone among the three, this stays with the archer who bought it: it is not
# GMS's grant, so it does not inherit GMS's party rule.
name: "Sharp Eyes - Bulwark"
description:
  "Grants Sharp Eyes a bonus to DEF."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BOW_MASTER skill_order: 4 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
base { def: 1000 }
